//M_Messenger.npc

*J_NAME		"Messenger Rucia"

*J_CHAT		"How are you? I'm the messenger of Morion, Rusia."
*J_CHAT		"I deliver urgent messages to the continent."
*J_CHAT		"Currently, all the kingdoms in Priston are under suppressing monsters."
*J_CHAT		"There are many powerful monster out of the village, so be careful."